{"pageProps":{"langParam":"zh-hans","languageKey":"zhHans","product":{"_id":"f1f0cc85-8065-4690-a06e-788fa55d8acf","description":{"_type":"localizedRichText","zhHans":[{"_key":"ce5e1fa52c8c","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"e37dcf9f2028","_type":"span","marks":["strong","1cdaea1a3c57"],"text":"设计师简介"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"1cdaea1a3c57","_type":"textAlign","align":"center"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"3ed70090b015","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"8a28ce8b3aa4","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":""}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"45416bdda76f","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"2b90e2295040","_type":"span","marks":["strong"],"text":"张蕾"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"9d0c502fd4f4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"b5f237c161b7","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"\n建筑师\n\n拥有多元化的建筑教育背景与国内外实践经验，本科毕业于厦门大学建筑系，曾赴美国科罗拉多大学交流，硕士毕业于瑞士门德里西奥学院建筑系。职业生涯涵盖从中国建筑科学研究院、上海UA尤安设计，到瑞士Caruso St John Architects及重庆市设计院等多个平台的实践，参与并负责了住宅、城市更新、规划、文化公建等多类型项目。\n\n她始终对空间本体、塑造空间的方法逻辑与空间原型抱有热情，她相信空间本身即是一种塑造力：既能重新定义场所，也能为人的活动赋予从功能到精神的多元可能。她也持续探索从经典原型中提炼可迁移的架构，并在设计中注重对场地特质的捕捉与强化，关注在地性、地域建筑与传统建筑的当代回应。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}]},"gallery":["https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kno2j23t/production/a6ec2fcb17f389217ad67a466333e47cbe3880e6-2624x2624.jpg","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kno2j23t/production/c427edc0563c6b08cdb2cfcd34a0f7f0bfa75842-2624x2624.jpg","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kno2j23t/production/b3274a69eade91b5d858c8f8d8867a5f1da09131-2624x2624.jpg","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kno2j23t/production/10d127018fe1771c1e28d4eec11293030eb90e88-2624x2624.jpg","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kno2j23t/production/9dccc25b702fea2b5d6ac5ba9c3e3030ecd34e0d-2536x2536.jpg","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kno2j23t/production/6bc0e79d89548543606d2a22774791a8444baa64-2624x2624.jpg","https://cdn.sanity.io/images/kno2j23t/production/dc1275acec8e7d5b72bb01734532e8d338c5da91-2624x2624.jpg"],"level1Category":{"_id":"ba7c95da-f832-458f-a6cd-0f171e854db6","coverURL":"https://c